# Open Graph Images Directory

This directory contains Open Graph images for social media sharing.

## Required Images:

- og-default.jpg (1200x630px) - Default Open Graph image
- og-home.jpg (1200x630px) - Homepage Open Graph image
- og-services.jpg (1200x630px) - Services page Open Graph image
- og-about.jpg (1200x630px) - About page Open Graph image
- og-contact.jpg (1200x630px) - Contact page Open Graph image
- og-service-penetration-testing.jpg (1200x630px) - Penetration Testing service
- og-service-security-audits.jpg (1200x630px) - Security Audits service
- og-service-incident-response.jpg (1200x630px) - Incident Response service
- og-service-compliance-consulting.jpg (1200x630px) - Compliance Consulting service

## Image Specifications:

- Dimensions: 1200x630 pixels (recommended for Open Graph)
- Format: JPG or PNG
- File size: Under 1MB for optimal loading
- Content: Should include company branding and relevant imagery

## Note:

These images are referenced in the metadata but need to be created and added to this directory.
Until then, the metadata will reference these paths, and social media platforms will use fallback images.
